WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.200
Snow and stone. A young woman walks a mountain path alone.

00:05.200 --> 00:10.400
She searches the wreck of a camp, calling without an answer.

00:10.400 --> 00:16.000
A baby dragon hides in her coat. She has been looking after it.

00:16.000 --> 00:22.200
An adult dragon fills the sky. Scales, heat, and a long shadow.

00:22.200 --> 00:28.400
Sintel: I kept your child safe. Do not take this one from me.

00:28.400 --> 00:36.000
The dragon does not yield. Wind and fire break the ridge apart.

00:36.000 --> 00:44.000
She falls, then rises, still heading toward the creature.

00:44.000 --> 00:52.000
Title card: Sintel. A Durian open movie from the Blender Foundation.
